<td id="A2.T9.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T9.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:375.6pt;">
<span id="A2.T9.2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T9.2.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 1: Analyze the Social Cue</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
