<span id="A2.T9.2.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- What does the social cue suggest about the user’s tone, intent, or emotional state?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T9.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T9.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T9.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:375.6pt;">
<span id="A2.T9.2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- <span id="A2.T9.2.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Social Cue:</span> {<span id="A2.T9.2.9.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">social_cue</span>}</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T9.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T9.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T9.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:375.6pt;">
<span id="A2.T9.2.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- <span id="A2.T9.2.10.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Reasoning:</span> Based on the social cue, the user appears to be [describe tone/intent/emotion]. This suggests they may respond well to [specific approach].</span>
</span></td></tr>
