</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T9.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T9.2.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T9.2.13.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:375.6pt;">
<span id="A2.T9.2.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- What does the task cue reveal about the user’s goals or expectations?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T9.2.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T9.2.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T9.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:375.6pt;">
<span id="A2.T9.2.14.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- <span id="A2.T9.2.14.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Task Cue:</span> {<span id="A2.T9.2.14.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">task_cue</span>}</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T9.2.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T9.2.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T9.2.15.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:375.6pt;">
<span id="A2.T9.2.15.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- <span id="A2.T9.2.15.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Reasoning:</span> The task cue indicates the user is looking for [specific goal]. This requires a response that is [specific quality, e.g., creative, structured, empathetic].</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T9.2.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T9.2.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T9.2.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T9.2.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T9.2.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:375.6pt;">
