<span id="A4.T12.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Consider the order of speed among NAME_1, NAME_2, and NAME_3, where NAME_1 is faster than NAME_2 but slower than NAME_3. Using this information, determine the fastest individual.</span>
