<span id="A4.T12.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">PersonaFuse</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T12.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A4.T12.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:199.2pt;">
<span id="A4.T12.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">To determine the fastest individual, we need to analyze the given information. Since NAME_1 is faster than NAME_2 but slower than NAME_3, we can create a list of their speeds from fastest to slowest: NAME_3, NAME_1, NAME_2. Therefore, NAME_3 is the fastest individual.</span>
