<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A5.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ Appendix E Human Annotation Interface ‣ PersonaFuse: A Personality Activation-Driven Framework for Enhancing Human-LLM Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> presents the annotation interface used in the human evaluation study.</p>
