<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Main Experiment Scores</h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this appendix, we report the absolute performance scores for all tasks: social-emotional intelligence (Table <a href="#A6.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ Appendix F Main Experiment Scores ‣ PersonaFuse: A Personality Activation-Driven Framework for Enhancing Human-LLM Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>), general intelligence (Table <a href="#A6.T14" title="Table 14 ‣ Appendix F Main Experiment Scores ‣ PersonaFuse: A Personality Activation-Driven Framework for Enhancing Human-LLM Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>), model safety (Table <a href="#A6.T15" title="Table 15 ‣ Appendix F Main Experiment Scores ‣ PersonaFuse: A Personality Activation-Driven Framework for Enhancing Human-LLM Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>), and downstream applications (Table <a href="#A6.T16" title="Table 16 ‣ Appendix F Main Experiment Scores ‣ PersonaFuse: A Personality Activation-Driven Framework for Enhancing Human-LLM Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>), respectively.</p>
</div>
